    "info": "Residency lifecycle owner API (LK1).\n\nRoutes:\nGET /lk/residency/pilot-access\nGET /lk/residency/catalog\nGET /lk/residency/status\nPOST /lk/residency/orders\nGET /lk/residency/orders/:orderId\nGET /lk/residency/orders/:orderId/payment\nPOST /lk/residency/orders/:orderId/reconcile\nPOST /lk/residency/orders/:orderId/cancel\n\nRequires the @padlhub/node-red-residency-lifecycle-api custom node.\nMutating routes require Idempotency-Key and the LK bearer.\nActivation is accepted only from CUP verified residency evidence.",
